=\"KO\">서비스 재기동 이후에도</span> OS <span lang=\"KO\">디스크 관련 지표가 높은 상태로 확인됨</span></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\"><b><span lang=\"KO\">확인 내용</span></b></span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\">Azure VM <span lang=\"KO\">메트릭에서&nbsp;</span>OS <span lang=\"KO\">디스크의</span> Queue Length<span lang=\"KO\">와</span> Disk Latency<span lang=\"KO\">가 반복적으로 증가하는 현상이 확인됩니다</span>.</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\"><img style=\"height:auto;max-width:100%;width:777px;\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"777\" height=\"439\" v:shapes=\"Picture_x0020_1\" uploadprocessed=\"true\"></span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\"><img style=\"height:auto;max-width:100%;width:778px;\" src=\"data:image/png;base64,\" width=\"778\" height=\"439\" v:shapes=\"_x0000_i1026\" uploadprocessed=\"true\"></span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span lang=\"KO\">확인 결과는 다음과 같습니다</span>.</span></p><ul style=\"list-style-type:disc;\"><li class=\"ck-list-marker-font-size ck-list-marker-font-family elementtoproof\" style=\"--ck-content-list-marker-font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;--ck-content-list-marker-font-size:10.0pt;margin-bottom:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-top:0in;tab-stops:list .5in;\" data-list-item-id=\"ea3635c0678ba3820b8aec1a48ff7c11f\"><p style=\"margin: 0;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\">OS <span lang=\"KO\">디스크</span> Queue Length<span lang=\"KO\">가 임계 기준인</span> 10<span lang=\"KO\">을 반복적으로 초과</span></span></p></li><li class=\"ck-list-marker-font-size ck-list-marker-font-family elementtoproof\" style=\"--ck-content-list-marker-font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;--ck-content-list-marker-font-size:10.0pt;margin-bottom:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-top:0in;tab-stops:list .5in;\" data-list-item-id=\"e1ea42dc8bcff3bcf0e2443d501475b32\"><p style=\"margin: 0;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span lang=\"KO\">일부 구간에서</span> Queue Length<span lang=\"KO\">가 약</span> 80~100 <span lang=\"KO\">수준까지 상승</span></span></p></li><li class=\"ck-list-marker-font-size ck-list-marker-font-family elementtoproof\" style=\"--ck-content-list-marker-font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;--ck-content-list-marker-font-size:10.0pt;margin-bottom:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-top:0in;tab-stops:list .5in;\" data-list-item-id=\"ecf95cae91fd3b2dd2d98a6b671451ba4\"><p style=\"margin: 0;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\">OS <span lang=\"KO\">디스크</span> Latency<span lang=\"KO\">가 일부 구간에서 약</span> 200~230ms<span lang=\"KO\">까지 상승</span></span></p></li><li class=\"ck-list-marker-font-size ck-list-marker-font-family elementtoproof\" style=\"--ck-content-list-marker-font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;--ck-content-list-marker-font-size:10.0pt;margin-bottom:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-top:0in;tab-stops:list .5in;\" data-list-item-id=\"e8ad8dbb38e91ccddb04c056053c47cca\"><p style=\"margin: 0;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\">Data Disk LUN 0 <span lang=\"KO\">및</span> LUN 1<span lang=\"KO\">은 상대적으로 낮은 수준을 유지</span></span></p></li><li class=\"ck-list-marker-font-size ck-list-marker-font-family elementtoproof\" style=\"--ck-content-list-marker-font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;--ck-content-list-marker-font-size:10.0pt;margin-bottom:0in;margin-right:0in;margin-top:0in;tab-stops:list .5in;\" data-list-item-id=\"ea0903744e690830a242f6fcb5ef2aff4\"><p style=\"margin: 0;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span lang=\"KO\">성능 저하가 주로</span> OS <span lang=\"KO\">디스크에 집중된 것으로 확인</span></span></p></li></ul><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span lang=\"KO\">현재</span> OS <span lang=\"KO\">디스크의 성능 한도는</span> 500 IOPS<span lang=\"KO\">로 구성되어 있습니다</span>.</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span lang=\"KO\">운영체제 로그</span>, <span lang=\"KO\">애플리케이션 로그</span>, <span lang=\"KO\">보안 에이전트</span>, <span lang=\"KO\">모니터링 에이전트 및 기타 프로세스의</span> I/O<span lang=\"KO\">가 동시에 발생할 경우 디스크 성능 한도에 도달하면서</span> Queue Length<span lang=\"KO\">와</span> Latency<span lang=\"KO\">가 증가할 수 있습니다</span>.</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span lang=\"KO\">현재</span> Azure <span lang=\"KO\">성능 차트만으로는</span> azuremonitoragent <span lang=\"KO\">또는</span> mdatp<span lang=\"KO\">가 직접적인 원인인지</span>, <span lang=\"KO\">다른 프로세스나 애플리케이션이 디스크</span> I/O<span lang=\"KO\">를 발생시켰는지까지 확인이 어렵고</span>,</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span lang=\"KO\">대상</span> VM<span lang=\"KO\">은</span> Azure Confidential VM<span lang=\"KO\">으로 구성되어 있어</span>, Azure <span lang=\"KO\">지원 측에서 게스트 운영체제 내부의 프로세스 및 로그를 직접 확인이 어려운데요</span>,</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span lang=\"KO\">정확한 원인 분석을 위해서는 다음과 같이 게스트</span> OS <span lang=\"KO\">로그를 수집하여 공유부탁드립니다</span>.</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\"><b><span lang=\"KO\">다음 단계</span></b></span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\">1. SOS Report <span lang=\"KO\">수집 및 공유 요청</span></span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span lang=\"KO\">대상</span> RHEL <span lang=\"KO\">서버에서 다음 명령을 실행하여</span> SOS Report<span lang=\"KO\">를 수집해 주시기 바랍니다</span>.</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\">sudo dnf install -y sos</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\">sudo sos report --batch</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span lang=\"KO\">수집이 완료되면 일반적으로 다음 경로에 압축 파일이 생성됩니다</span>.</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\">/var/tmp/sosreport-&lt;hostname&gt;-&lt;date&gt;.tar.xz</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" style=\"margin: 0in;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Malgun Gothic&quot;,sans-serif;font-size:10.0pt;\"><span lang=\"KO\">생성된</span> SOS Report <span lang=\"KO\">파일을 다음 링크로 업로드해 주시기 바랍니다</span>.</span></p><p class=\"elementtoproof\" styl